WEBVTT

01:38.150 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.130 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 14]

02:04.310 --> 02:05.840
Why are you having a fever?

02:06.590 --> 02:08.030
Where did you go?

02:11.170 --> 02:12.450
Nowhere.

02:13.110 --> 02:14.370
What were you doing?

02:14.390 --> 02:15.550
You reek of alcohol.

02:16.910 --> 02:18.150
Nothing much.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.710
The bamboo forest at night

02:21.710 --> 02:22.680
is a bit chilly.

02:23.240 --> 02:24.430
You got sick just as I recovered.

02:24.680 --> 02:25.750
Let me take off your shoes

02:26.079 --> 02:27.470
and cover you with the quilt.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.560
No need to take them off.

02:35.030 --> 02:36.360
Let me do it.

02:36.870 --> 02:38.590
You don't know how to take them off.

02:45.030 --> 02:46.190
Here, put… put them here.

02:55.590 --> 02:56.800
Just rest up.

02:57.710 --> 02:59.030
I'll go boil some water for you.

03:00.590 --> 03:01.710
No need.

03:02.420 --> 03:03.610
You can use the hot water to wash your face

03:03.630 --> 03:04.600
and then get some proper rest.

03:05.680 --> 03:07.800
No need. I can't sleep.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.240
Why can't you sleep?

03:11.400 --> 03:13.150
Too noisy. Really.

03:13.150 --> 03:15.120
They're making such a racket over there.

03:15.750 --> 03:17.240
How can I sleep like this?

03:30.280 --> 03:30.910
Xuanye.

03:32.870 --> 03:34.260
You drank Fubai Wine, didn't you?

03:34.800 --> 03:35.240
It's fine.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.840
It's fine.

03:38.079 --> 03:39.750
I drink it every day.

03:41.150 --> 03:42.150
I'm fine.

03:53.390 --> 03:54.310
What are you looking at?

03:56.960 --> 03:57.590
Nothing.

04:02.710 --> 04:03.960
Chi Xue, do you have any family?

04:04.840 --> 04:05.360
Yes.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.290
Where are they?

04:08.240 --> 04:09.120
Xuanye is my family.

04:10.960 --> 04:13.030
I mean actual family—

04:13.190 --> 04:14.840
parents, siblings, that kind.

04:16.190 --> 04:17.310
I don't remember.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.560
How could you not remember?

04:20.430 --> 04:21.160
For as long as I can remember,

04:21.190 --> 04:22.160
I've been at Ganshan Clinic.

04:22.620 --> 04:23.850
I haven't met any members of my family.

04:29.020 --> 04:31.260
Have you met Xuanye's family then?

04:33.430 --> 04:34.600
What are they like?

04:36.040 --> 04:36.800
Just like you.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.120
Like me?

04:40.010 --> 04:42.020
Talkative, always dropping by,

04:42.810 --> 04:43.610
and good at cooking.

04:48.120 --> 04:49.870
He must miss them a lot.

05:07.870 --> 05:08.800
I'm coming in.

05:12.810 --> 05:15.640
Xuanye, are you awake?

05:19.320 --> 05:21.320
Where did Chi Xue go?

05:22.920 --> 05:23.680
Xuanye?

05:34.120 --> 05:35.390
Where did you go?

05:35.720 --> 05:36.680
I went to have breakfast.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.800
Go get Youhuang.

05:37.830 --> 05:38.390
Xuanye is sick.

05:38.390 --> 05:39.720
He has a high fever.

06:12.120 --> 06:12.800
Youhuang!

06:13.190 --> 06:13.800
Youhuang!

06:14.240 --> 06:15.720
Open the door! Xuanye is sick.

06:16.560 --> 06:17.240
Open the door!

06:17.600 --> 06:18.430
Physician Jiu is ill?

06:19.720 --> 06:20.240
Where's Youhuang?

06:20.560 --> 06:21.510
Youhuang went back to get help.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.270
He left last night.

06:24.190 --> 06:24.870
What should we do then?

06:25.430 --> 06:26.310
Treat the illness, of course.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.950
Can't Physician Jiu treat himself?

06:28.750 --> 06:30.240
I'm watching over a corpse here.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.430
I—I can't leave.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.120
Why don't you stay here and…

07:25.840 --> 07:26.310
Come out!

08:42.900 --> 08:44.150
Have some water.

09:09.570 --> 09:10.410
Wuniang.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.750
So you are in the room.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.060
Why didn't you answer

09:16.080 --> 09:17.130
when I knocked?

09:21.510 --> 09:22.510
I'm going to fetch water.

09:22.800 --> 09:24.320
Come, go with me.

09:27.750 --> 09:29.080
It's too far.

09:29.440 --> 09:31.360
I can't carry it all alone.

09:32.720 --> 09:33.470
Ask the servants

09:33.840 --> 09:34.670
to go with you.

09:35.550 --> 09:37.030
They're so dull-witted

09:37.800 --> 09:39.530
and can't even speak a proper sentence.

09:40.610 --> 09:41.580
In your eyes,

09:42.050 --> 09:43.080
aren't I just the same?

09:43.510 --> 09:44.510
Dull-witted, stupid,

09:44.930 --> 09:46.500
and bad with words.

09:47.710 --> 09:49.150
Wuniang, you...

09:49.270 --> 09:50.720
Father, do you have anything else to say?

09:52.720 --> 09:53.200
Wuniang.

09:54.320 --> 09:55.390
I'm sorry.

09:56.150 --> 09:56.720
Yesterday,

09:57.120 --> 09:57.910
I shouldn't have hit you.

09:58.300 --> 09:59.170
That was my fault.

10:00.840 --> 10:01.510
But I

10:02.550 --> 10:04.270
was just afraid you'd make a mistake.

10:07.960 --> 10:08.550
By the way,

10:10.030 --> 10:10.840
last night,

10:11.150 --> 10:12.120
I had another dream.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.290
I dreamed that the two of us

10:13.310 --> 10:14.890
returned to Guima Fort again.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.510
It was a rainy night.

10:26.390 --> 10:28.080
The royal flag got blown away.

10:28.790 --> 10:30.150
I wanted to go retrieve it,

10:30.790 --> 10:32.050
but you desperately tried to stop me

10:32.080 --> 10:33.030
from going.

10:33.390 --> 10:34.600
Then you went instead.

10:35.440 --> 10:37.440
You were gone for four or five days.

10:37.460 --> 10:38.530
Not a trace of you.

10:38.910 --> 10:40.510
I was worried and went to look for you.

10:41.830 --> 10:43.760
I finally found you at Haizi Bay,

10:45.020 --> 10:46.380
but your arms and legs

10:47.120 --> 10:48.750
were all broken.

10:50.140 --> 10:51.060
Yet even then,

10:51.750 --> 10:54.360
you were still tightly biting onto the royal flag.

10:54.720 --> 10:55.390
Father,

10:56.750 --> 10:57.360
that happened

10:57.390 --> 10:58.910
a long time ago.

11:01.890 --> 11:02.480
Yes.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.440
But for me,

11:06.460 --> 11:08.390
it feels like it happened just yesterday.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.200
Wuniang,

11:10.600 --> 11:11.790
you're a good girl.

11:13.240 --> 11:14.240
Without you,

11:14.910 --> 11:16.750
I might not have made it to this day.

11:17.030 --> 11:18.210
No matter what others say,

11:18.240 --> 11:20.000
I know in my heart—

11:23.120 --> 11:24.240
we, father and daughter,

11:24.600 --> 11:25.480
have done

11:25.650 --> 11:27.410
something truly remarkable.

11:34.390 --> 11:35.270
I've made up my mind.

11:38.030 --> 11:39.080
I'm going to close the inn.

11:40.150 --> 11:41.030
Then we'll leave.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.600
Let's leave this place, shall we?

11:44.440 --> 11:44.960
Leave?

11:45.670 --> 11:46.120
Yes.

11:46.390 --> 11:47.480
You don't like it here, do you?

11:47.500 --> 11:48.670
So let's leave.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.360
Then,

11:51.080 --> 11:51.750
where will we go?

11:53.390 --> 11:55.270
We can go anywhere we want.

11:58.840 --> 11:59.600
We'll find

12:00.240 --> 12:02.120
a scenic place to settle down.

12:03.150 --> 12:04.270
Just the two of us.

12:05.030 --> 12:07.360
We'll live a quiet life together.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.360
What do you say?

12:16.000 --> 12:16.600
Wuniang.

12:17.320 --> 12:18.080
Why are you laughing?

12:18.770 --> 12:19.480
Nothing.

12:20.510 --> 12:21.390
I just think

12:22.750 --> 12:23.870
your idea is wonderful.

12:25.390 --> 12:26.740
I've been tired of this place for a long time.

12:28.670 --> 12:29.670
That's great!

12:31.180 --> 12:32.420
I'll start packing right away.

12:36.600 --> 12:37.270
Look.

12:38.390 --> 12:39.670
I carved this for you.

12:40.200 --> 12:40.910
Do you like it?

12:43.750 --> 12:44.840
Your craftsmanship

12:45.120 --> 12:46.480
is always the best.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.910
Glad you think so.

12:48.930 --> 12:50.130
I'll go pack now.

12:50.840 --> 12:51.550
You start packing too.

12:51.870 --> 12:52.360
Okay.

12:52.390 --> 12:52.910
Good.

13:10.150 --> 13:10.790
Wuniang,

13:11.720 --> 13:12.600
we've caught the man.

13:29.670 --> 13:30.360
You're awake.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.240
You're still having a fever.

13:37.790 --> 13:38.550
I'm fine.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.240
Here, drink some water.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.000
I just fetched it.

13:45.030 --> 13:47.390
Oh, by the way, Youhuang has returned to Guangping City.

13:49.960 --> 13:50.600
I know.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.550
His men were killed.

13:53.120 --> 13:53.720
We all believe

13:53.750 --> 13:55.040
it was done by someone at the inn.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.840
He went back to get reinforcements.

13:57.870 --> 13:58.720
Was it a demon?

14:02.440 --> 14:03.330
If it was a demon,

14:03.360 --> 14:04.440
he's no match for it.

14:05.910 --> 14:07.480
I gave him something to protect himself.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.750
He'll be alright.

14:10.590 --> 14:12.400
Lie back down and rest a bit more.

14:14.870 --> 14:15.510
Banxia.

14:16.510 --> 14:17.600
Once I'm better,

14:17.840 --> 14:19.000
I'll take you away from here.

14:20.550 --> 14:21.960
You've been taking care of me all this time.

14:22.550 --> 14:24.000
I bet you haven't had a proper rest.

14:25.030 --> 14:25.790
Thank you.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.840
You don't need

14:31.000 --> 14:32.360
to say things like that.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.390
Who's it?

15:33.960 --> 15:35.910
The face must be pale, the lips red.

15:36.120 --> 15:36.870
The paler, the better.

15:37.030 --> 15:37.790
The redder, the better.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.910
She also needs a flower mark.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.750
Wuniang likes it, and so do I.

15:42.770 --> 15:44.310
I like it too.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.440
Wuniang.

15:56.550 --> 15:57.150
One.

15:58.200 --> 15:58.750
Two.

16:00.270 --> 16:00.840
Three, four.

16:02.000 --> 16:04.870
Five, six, seven.

16:09.890 --> 16:10.480
Eight.

16:17.150 --> 16:17.790
Xuanye.

16:23.670 --> 16:24.200
This...

16:29.260 --> 16:29.850
This...

16:30.360 --> 16:30.960
Xuanye.

16:32.080 --> 16:32.720
Xuanye!

16:35.390 --> 16:36.120
Yanqiu.

16:42.850 --> 16:43.600
Wuniang.

16:44.200 --> 16:44.870
Miss Duan.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.390
You're awake.

16:51.400 --> 16:51.870
Chief.

16:53.840 --> 16:54.620
You're...

16:55.960 --> 16:56.810
all awake.

17:01.310 --> 17:01.910
Wuniang.

17:06.349 --> 17:07.790
What are you doing?

17:09.170 --> 17:10.200
Why have you

17:10.230 --> 17:11.550
tied everyone up here?

17:12.109 --> 17:13.440
What are you doing?

17:14.099 --> 17:15.410
Why have you

17:15.440 --> 17:16.920
tied everyone up here?

17:21.700 --> 17:22.660
Miss Duan,

17:23.750 --> 17:25.000
don't you know why?

17:27.480 --> 17:28.310
What's going on?

17:28.880 --> 17:29.720
Untie us now!

17:30.070 --> 17:30.720
Untie us!

17:32.150 --> 17:32.880
Mr. Feng Tian,

17:33.650 --> 17:34.370
what is your good daughter

17:34.390 --> 17:35.350
trying to do?

17:36.000 --> 17:36.960
How would I know?

17:38.750 --> 17:39.400
Wuniang,

17:40.150 --> 17:41.350
what are you doing?

17:41.940 --> 17:42.540
Why have you

17:42.560 --> 17:43.800
tied everyone up?

17:43.880 --> 17:45.240
Hurry, untie us now.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.700
Thank you all for being here.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.000
I'm glad

17:52.310 --> 17:53.580
that you came.

17:56.630 --> 17:57.960
Perhaps you don't know yet—

17:58.750 --> 18:00.200
today is my birthday.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.310
It's said that

18:02.960 --> 18:04.160
one should celebrate

18:04.680 --> 18:06.790
one's birthday with friends and family

18:07.480 --> 18:08.350
to be blessed.

18:11.380 --> 18:12.950
My life has been full of hardships,

18:14.110 --> 18:16.350
with only my father by my side.

18:17.090 --> 18:17.890
So I've taken the liberty

18:18.720 --> 18:19.680
of inviting you all

18:20.590 --> 18:21.830
to celebrate with me.

18:23.030 --> 18:24.310
I hope you won't take offense.

18:30.160 --> 18:31.400
I don't remember

18:32.690 --> 18:34.060
how old I am this year.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.920
Nor do I remember

18:37.960 --> 18:38.700
what day

18:39.310 --> 18:40.240
my birthday is.

18:41.360 --> 18:43.690
Is it the day I was created

18:45.120 --> 18:46.450
or the day I gained

18:46.480 --> 18:47.240
self-awareness?

18:49.240 --> 18:50.200
But it doesn't matter.

18:51.230 --> 18:52.030
From today on,

18:53.080 --> 18:54.190
I'll be like everyone else—

18:54.830 --> 18:55.960
I'll have a birthday too.

18:57.880 --> 18:58.750
Today is

18:59.750 --> 19:00.920
the ninth day of July.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.200
The Heavenly Noble Star enters fate,

19:03.750 --> 19:04.960
favorable for all endeavors.

19:05.240 --> 19:07.440
All things done shall succeed; all wishes shall be granted.

19:09.790 --> 19:10.350
Father.

19:12.140 --> 19:13.600
How do you like…

19:15.490 --> 19:16.530
the date I picked?

19:17.590 --> 19:18.160
It's great.

19:19.590 --> 19:20.110
Oh, right.

19:21.300 --> 19:22.850
I also made a bowl of birthday noodles.

19:24.530 --> 19:26.160
A guest once told me

19:26.880 --> 19:27.880
you're supposed

19:29.240 --> 19:30.750
to eat longevity noodles on your birthday.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.640
I can't taste anything,

19:58.620 --> 19:59.620
and I can't swallow.

20:04.110 --> 20:04.750
Father.

20:06.170 --> 20:07.060
Aren't all people supposed to be able

20:07.680 --> 20:08.480
to eat?

20:10.210 --> 20:10.840
Why

20:11.910 --> 20:12.590
can't I do it?

20:16.510 --> 20:17.230
It's okay.

20:18.370 --> 20:19.260
Then I just won't eat them.

20:22.110 --> 20:23.550
Today is my birthday.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.680
Have you prepared any gifts for me?

20:27.480 --> 20:28.450
Who says we're celebrating your birthday?

20:28.830 --> 20:30.510
I'm an official from Guangping.

20:30.680 --> 20:32.510
Kidnapping an official is a serious crime!

20:32.750 --> 20:33.270
Li!

20:36.490 --> 20:37.200
Miss,

20:38.720 --> 20:39.840
this all happened so suddenly.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.240
We didn't have time to prepare a gift for you.

20:41.510 --> 20:42.350
That was our mistake.

20:42.550 --> 20:43.160
How about this?

20:44.270 --> 20:45.160
If you release us,

20:46.000 --> 20:46.880
we'll go buy you some gifts.

20:47.240 --> 20:47.830
Good, good.

20:48.350 --> 20:49.200
That's a good idea.

20:51.960 --> 20:53.110
Officer,

20:54.350 --> 20:55.400
you're so bad,

20:56.470 --> 20:57.780
lying to a child like that.

20:58.790 --> 21:01.160
If I let you go,

21:01.680 --> 21:03.110
I'm afraid you'd disappear immediately.

21:05.030 --> 21:06.230
How would I ever find you again?

21:10.160 --> 21:10.790
How about this?

21:11.790 --> 21:14.510
I've always loved listening to stories since I was little.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.440
Why don't each of you

21:16.940 --> 21:18.410
tell me a story?

21:19.030 --> 21:19.860
That'll count as your gift.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.740
You crazy woman!

21:32.200 --> 21:33.030
Don't hurt him!

21:33.470 --> 21:35.400
I'll tell one! I'll go first.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.030
Alright.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.000
I'm not great

21:42.710 --> 21:43.790
at telling stories,

21:45.340 --> 21:46.100
so I'll share something

21:46.130 --> 21:47.260
I actually experienced.

21:51.160 --> 21:52.790
That year, I was ordered to catch a criminal.

21:53.550 --> 21:55.680
I chased the gang leader alone

21:56.000 --> 21:56.880
all the way to Qinglong Gorge.

21:57.970 --> 21:59.490
During the fight, the gang leader and I

21:59.880 --> 22:01.350
fell into a ravine and lost consciousness.

22:02.480 --> 22:03.550
When I woke up,

22:04.110 --> 22:05.680
the gang leader was already awake,

22:06.400 --> 22:07.610
not a scratch on him.

22:08.840 --> 22:10.070
But he didn't harm me.

22:11.880 --> 22:12.510
Why not?

22:13.240 --> 22:14.550
Because we were surrounded

22:15.920 --> 22:18.400
by hungry, fierce wolves.

22:20.480 --> 22:22.160
Though I was an officer

22:22.590 --> 22:23.350
and he was a criminal,

22:23.920 --> 22:24.960
surrounded by wolves,

22:25.410 --> 22:26.820
we had no choice but to join forces.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.440
We stood back to back

22:29.000 --> 22:29.920
and fought all night long.

22:30.640 --> 22:31.920
In the end, we drove the wolves away

22:32.550 --> 22:33.400
and made it out alive.

22:35.680 --> 22:36.400
Enemies

22:36.750 --> 22:37.590
turned into partners.

22:38.540 --> 22:39.190
And then?

22:39.880 --> 22:41.550
Then the soldiers found us.

22:42.590 --> 22:43.680
I was taken for treatment,

22:44.400 --> 22:45.590
and he was thrown into the dungeon.

22:47.120 --> 22:47.640
Then

22:48.400 --> 22:49.030
what happened?

22:49.400 --> 22:50.790
Then he was beheaded.

22:52.790 --> 22:53.550
You didn't save him?

22:54.350 --> 22:55.590
Why would I save him?

22:56.200 --> 22:57.720
He was less injured than you,

22:58.030 --> 22:59.100
woke up before you,

22:59.830 --> 23:02.070
and could've killed you easily.

23:02.630 --> 23:03.870
But he spared your life.

23:04.790 --> 23:05.510
That means

23:06.000 --> 23:07.240
you owed him a debt.

23:07.570 --> 23:09.050
I'm an officer, and he was a criminal.

23:09.630 --> 23:11.350
He killed someone and paid with his life. That's the law.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.110
Under the law,

23:13.520 --> 23:14.350
there are no personal debts!

23:17.090 --> 23:17.970
How

23:19.550 --> 23:20.920
righteous of you.

23:22.510 --> 23:23.400
Then let me ask you:

23:24.310 --> 23:25.110
what about

23:26.000 --> 23:26.870
those wolves?

23:28.000 --> 23:28.590
What about them?

23:29.590 --> 23:30.240
You

23:31.070 --> 23:32.150
killed the wolves.

23:32.960 --> 23:33.830
What should we make of that?

23:34.590 --> 23:35.630
Those wolves were vicious man-killers.

23:36.380 --> 23:37.380
They deserved to die!

23:40.200 --> 23:41.110
It's just

23:42.310 --> 23:44.310
the law of the jungle, isn't it?

23:45.480 --> 23:46.350
That day, the wolves

23:46.790 --> 23:47.590
were weaker than you,

23:48.240 --> 23:49.350
so you killed them.

23:50.630 --> 23:51.670
The criminal was weaker than you,

23:52.400 --> 23:53.350
so you killed him.

23:54.720 --> 23:55.550
And today,

23:56.750 --> 23:58.440
you are weaker than me.

23:58.980 --> 24:00.980
So now you're the one on the chopping block.

24:01.660 --> 24:03.150
Shut up with all that

24:03.900 --> 24:05.250
hypocritical nonsense!

24:10.060 --> 24:11.750
What a high-sounding story

24:12.440 --> 24:13.830
about fake righteousness.

24:14.520 --> 24:15.040
Isn't that

24:15.060 --> 24:15.950
a great story?

24:16.880 --> 24:17.480
No.

24:27.910 --> 24:28.710
It's your turn.

24:29.720 --> 24:30.750
I have no story to tell.

24:31.270 --> 24:32.110
Yanqiu.

24:32.830 --> 24:33.400
You

24:34.150 --> 24:35.200
have no story to tell,

24:36.510 --> 24:37.950
or there's nothing worth mentioning?

24:43.150 --> 24:44.380
You simply don't understand

24:45.350 --> 24:46.350
what love is.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.400
Manniang and I fell in love at first sight

24:54.400 --> 24:55.350
and got married.

24:56.830 --> 24:58.260
I thought we'd grow old together.

25:05.270 --> 25:06.090
I never imagined

25:07.350 --> 25:09.160
she was a demon who killed people.

25:10.490 --> 25:11.570
After her death,

25:12.790 --> 25:14.830
I was consumed by grief and longing.

25:15.920 --> 25:17.240
That's why I fell under the spell

25:17.270 --> 25:17.880
of your Fubai Wine

25:19.440 --> 25:20.880
and lingered in this place.

25:25.390 --> 25:26.350
But in the end,

25:28.880 --> 25:30.270
she still died at the hands

25:30.290 --> 25:31.530
of that demon hunter.

25:36.070 --> 25:37.000
Do you know

25:38.430 --> 25:39.270
why your wife didn't flee

25:39.290 --> 25:40.400
even after her tracks

25:41.440 --> 25:42.390
were exposed?

25:48.350 --> 25:49.350
For you,

25:51.000 --> 25:52.590
she risked her life.

25:54.500 --> 25:55.610
Yet after her death,

25:55.630 --> 25:57.220
you enjoyed drinking with her killer.

25:59.260 --> 26:00.300
That's how you missed her?

26:00.790 --> 26:01.680
She killed people.

26:04.310 --> 26:06.070
What's wrong with a demon killing people?

26:08.480 --> 26:09.880
She only did it

26:12.130 --> 26:13.850
because she was a demon.

26:15.070 --> 26:16.840
I've watched plays.

26:18.510 --> 26:21.590
They value love and relationships

26:22.250 --> 26:23.770
so much.

26:24.480 --> 26:25.480
But I know those stories

26:25.480 --> 26:26.350
are all fake.

26:27.380 --> 26:29.060
What's real is finding a fitting match,

26:30.690 --> 26:32.020
being fickle,

26:33.440 --> 26:34.880
and falling for someone new.

26:36.410 --> 26:38.110
What's real is selfishness and hypocrisy.

26:39.610 --> 26:40.590
Everything you said

26:41.590 --> 26:43.750
was nothing but false pretenses.

26:52.950 --> 26:53.710
Father.

26:57.480 --> 27:00.350
You used to tell me

27:01.680 --> 27:02.440
a person

27:03.420 --> 27:04.300
should be forgiving,

27:05.320 --> 27:06.080
frugal,

27:06.960 --> 27:08.040
kind, and upright.

27:08.750 --> 27:09.470
Yes.

27:13.160 --> 27:14.350
But most of the people I've met

27:15.930 --> 27:17.490
are just like them.

27:18.610 --> 27:19.440
Stupid,

27:20.590 --> 27:21.350
selfish,

27:22.140 --> 27:22.970
hypocritical,

27:23.490 --> 27:24.450
and full of lies!

27:29.220 --> 27:29.960
Is this

27:31.280 --> 27:33.040
what you want me to become?

27:33.550 --> 27:34.680
No.

27:35.410 --> 27:36.280
No.

27:37.760 --> 27:38.510
You said

27:40.500 --> 27:41.840
life in the desert was lonely and harsh,

27:42.590 --> 27:44.360
and you couldn't bear it alone,

27:46.510 --> 27:48.410
so you created me.

27:51.920 --> 27:53.670
You said I was your daughter,

27:54.330 --> 27:55.850
so I truly believed

27:57.400 --> 27:59.130
you were my father.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.110
You said…

28:11.310 --> 28:13.290
at your old house in Guangping City,

28:14.270 --> 28:15.680
there was an orange tree

28:18.030 --> 28:19.200
that bore

28:19.200 --> 28:20.720
so much fruit every year.

28:24.350 --> 28:26.110
I can't taste anything,

28:27.200 --> 28:29.120
but I still wanted to see it.

28:37.000 --> 28:37.830
But Father,

28:39.480 --> 28:41.440
we traveled thousands of miles,

28:42.280 --> 28:43.000
and when we reached the doorstep,

28:43.030 --> 28:44.720
why didn't you dare to go in?

29:02.640 --> 29:03.790
Because you were afraid.

29:05.340 --> 29:06.350
You were just afraid.

29:07.070 --> 29:08.830
You saw me as a monster.

29:09.510 --> 29:11.270
You were afraid I'd hurt your family.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.070
But aren't…

29:12.430 --> 29:13.980
aren't I your daughter?

29:15.600 --> 29:16.770
What kind of father

29:16.790 --> 29:18.270
would be afraid of his own daughter?

29:19.310 --> 29:20.750
What's wrong with you?

29:22.170 --> 29:22.790
You said

29:23.750 --> 29:24.960
this place was good,

29:26.840 --> 29:28.550
that you'd open an inn here.

29:30.110 --> 29:31.110
You even gave it

29:31.110 --> 29:32.110
a name:

29:33.590 --> 29:34.830
Reunion Inn.

29:35.550 --> 29:36.750
Reunion with whom?

29:37.590 --> 29:38.960
You and me?

29:40.590 --> 29:42.350
This isn't an inn at all,

29:42.830 --> 29:44.750
but a cage where you imprison me.

29:44.920 --> 29:45.350
You…

29:46.130 --> 29:47.410
You want to trap me here

29:47.440 --> 29:48.550
forever.

29:48.900 --> 29:49.450
If…

29:49.960 --> 29:51.790
if you're afraid of me,

29:52.060 --> 29:53.910
why did you create me?

29:54.160 --> 29:56.750
If you believe I'll never be more than a demon,

29:56.910 --> 29:58.590
why did you teach me so many

29:58.590 --> 30:00.270
human values?

30:01.440 --> 30:02.000
You

30:02.830 --> 30:04.680
fear me like a viper,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.960
treat me like a prisoner,

30:07.400 --> 30:09.640
and yet call me your daughter.

30:10.000 --> 30:11.400
You keep saying

30:11.400 --> 30:12.400
it's all for my own good.

30:12.400 --> 30:14.440
Do you know that's the thing

30:14.460 --> 30:16.110
I hate most about you?

30:16.180 --> 30:18.110
Daughter, what's…

30:19.050 --> 30:22.710
w-what's wrong with you?

30:48.240 --> 30:48.920
Daughter.

31:13.270 --> 31:14.030
Wuniang,

31:15.290 --> 31:16.220
I understand now.

31:17.590 --> 31:19.310
You long for genuine feelings

31:20.120 --> 31:20.920
and love.

31:24.440 --> 31:26.190
The moon waxes and wanes.

31:27.260 --> 31:28.480
People are the same.

31:32.140 --> 31:32.790
Yes,

31:34.480 --> 31:35.930
some people are pedantic,

31:37.060 --> 31:38.430
but they might be brave.

31:39.040 --> 31:40.280
Some people are selfish,

31:41.180 --> 31:42.420
but they might be intelligent.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.900
No one is perfect.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.760
We are all like this.

31:48.590 --> 31:49.680
Your father is the same.

31:51.170 --> 31:51.700
Yes.

31:53.630 --> 31:55.350
You're right.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.160
Miss Duan,

31:59.200 --> 32:00.950
you truly are the one I've chosen.

32:03.400 --> 32:04.440
You're better than all the others.

32:08.400 --> 32:09.270
It's just a pity…

32:12.000 --> 32:13.550
that you're about to die.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.200
I once told you

32:28.640 --> 32:29.880
I had a brother.

32:31.680 --> 32:33.240
He was just like me once,

32:34.320 --> 32:35.320
trapped here,

32:35.350 --> 32:36.830
living a miserable life.

32:37.660 --> 32:39.320
But he came up with a solution.

32:41.130 --> 32:41.980
He found someone

32:42.000 --> 32:43.040
he liked,

32:43.550 --> 32:44.920
disguised himself as that person,

32:46.000 --> 32:47.500
and then went home in their place.

32:50.250 --> 32:51.970
My brother has been gone for a long time now.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.450
I don't know if his new family

32:54.480 --> 32:55.590
likes him or not.

32:59.310 --> 33:00.070
Miss Duan,

33:01.680 --> 33:03.070
I've also waited for a long time.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.440
I really like you.

33:07.270 --> 33:08.590
I like your appearance

33:09.270 --> 33:10.550
and your personality.

33:12.550 --> 33:13.440
Don't worry.

33:13.590 --> 33:15.070
After I take your place,

33:16.440 --> 33:17.550
I'll definitely take good care of

33:17.550 --> 33:18.310
your family.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.000
I believe

33:21.800 --> 33:22.920
your loved ones…

33:22.950 --> 33:23.390
Banxia.

33:23.820 --> 33:25.510
will surely like me too.

33:26.920 --> 33:28.200
All the things you wanted to do

33:28.200 --> 33:29.750
but were too afraid to try—

33:30.310 --> 33:31.720
I'll do them for you.

33:34.070 --> 33:34.680
Wuniang.

33:35.160 --> 33:35.830
You lunatic!

33:36.110 --> 33:36.630
Daughter!

33:43.200 --> 33:44.030
Have you finished talking?

33:47.550 --> 33:48.550
Mr. Feng Tian,

33:49.200 --> 33:50.600
now you see what kind of person

33:50.950 --> 33:52.300
your daughter is, don't you?

33:52.920 --> 33:53.440
No…

33:59.920 --> 34:01.550
You're not sick?

34:02.160 --> 34:03.160
You didn't drink that wine?

34:04.350 --> 34:06.050
So you've been acting all along.

34:07.430 --> 34:08.800
What a shame

34:09.360 --> 34:11.320
that a blockhead like you gained self-awareness.

34:12.260 --> 34:13.310
You don't even know

34:13.330 --> 34:14.770
basic decency and moral values,

34:15.139 --> 34:16.500
yet you're so eager to lecture others.

34:18.590 --> 34:19.630
I'm in a good mood today.

34:20.210 --> 34:22.320
I'll teach you a truth that holds true

34:22.360 --> 34:23.710
for both humans and demons—

34:24.440 --> 34:25.440
evil

34:25.960 --> 34:27.230
can never triumph over good.

34:43.340 --> 34:44.030
Chi Xue!

36:41.550 --> 36:42.150
Xuanye,

36:42.290 --> 36:43.530
cut the net.

36:43.760 --> 36:45.030
I didn't bring my sword. Don't you know that?

36:46.320 --> 36:47.760
Why are you looking at me? Do something!

36:49.940 --> 36:50.680
Transform!

37:06.370 --> 37:07.250
Get off of me!

37:17.420 --> 37:18.100
Get off!

37:18.320 --> 37:18.990
Get off!

37:19.300 --> 37:20.030
Get off!

37:22.590 --> 37:23.480
How dare you hit me!

37:38.360 --> 37:39.030
Xuanye.

37:47.690 --> 37:48.390
She's leaving.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.280
Chi Xue,

37:49.510 --> 37:50.310
let's end this quickly.

38:03.230 --> 38:04.500
This wound is quite deep.

38:05.190 --> 38:05.800
Mr. Feng,

38:06.400 --> 38:07.590
where do you keep the wound medicine?

38:10.280 --> 38:11.100
Mr. Feng Tian?

38:16.190 --> 38:16.840
Mr. Feng?

38:17.440 --> 38:17.960
Forget it.

38:18.600 --> 38:19.200
There should be

38:19.230 --> 38:20.280
some basic medicine in Xuanye's room.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.250
I'll go check.

38:21.760 --> 38:22.400
Thanks.

38:53.380 --> 38:54.650
Miss Duan, what are you looking for?

39:17.550 --> 39:18.880
Looks just like you, doesn't it?

39:21.760 --> 39:22.760
It looks just like you, right?

39:23.990 --> 39:24.590
You...

39:27.070 --> 39:28.070
Be quiet.

39:29.920 --> 39:31.510
I don't want to kill you yet.

39:33.300 --> 39:34.090
I've heard

39:35.840 --> 39:37.000
that after people die,

39:37.870 --> 39:39.140
their faces stop looking nice.

39:42.230 --> 39:43.590
Today is my birthday.

39:44.880 --> 39:46.480
Let me show you a little magic trick, okay?

39:48.590 --> 39:49.400
Watch closely.

39:51.030 --> 39:51.550
One,

39:52.480 --> 39:53.070
two,

39:54.030 --> 39:54.590
three.

40:10.880 --> 40:11.840
Miss Duan.

40:13.960 --> 40:14.710
Miss Duan,

40:15.800 --> 40:16.760
where are you?

40:19.490 --> 40:20.400
Am I beautiful?

40:23.850 --> 40:24.480
Now,

40:26.260 --> 40:27.660
we look exactly the same.

40:30.280 --> 40:31.150
Very soon,

40:32.510 --> 40:33.840
I'll become you.

40:37.870 --> 40:38.610
Get away from me!

40:39.630 --> 40:41.630
When I first saw you,

40:42.840 --> 40:43.710
I thought,

40:45.200 --> 40:46.200
how wonderful it would be

40:46.230 --> 40:47.280
if I could be you.

40:49.110 --> 40:50.330
You're so free

40:51.070 --> 40:52.310
and unrestrained,

40:53.250 --> 40:55.060
like no one can force you

40:56.190 --> 40:57.880
to do anything you don't want.

41:02.030 --> 41:02.920
But somehow,

41:04.020 --> 41:06.020
I always feel that you're not happy.

41:09.440 --> 41:10.440
That's not true.

41:11.280 --> 41:12.070
I am happy.

41:13.900 --> 41:15.820
Is it so hard to admit that

41:16.510 --> 41:17.430
you're not doing well?

41:18.880 --> 41:20.400
You humans

41:21.190 --> 41:22.400
are so hypocritical.

41:25.730 --> 41:26.820
So, Miss Duan,

41:27.880 --> 41:29.030
let me take your place.

41:30.660 --> 41:32.180
Let me take your name,

41:32.690 --> 41:33.570
your identity,

41:34.000 --> 41:34.960
and your life.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.440
I swear,

41:37.400 --> 41:39.050
I'll live happier than you ever did.

41:39.360 --> 41:40.880
I'll live more like a human than you.

41:41.760 --> 41:42.550
No.

41:43.230 --> 41:44.480
No, I won't let you!

41:45.360 --> 41:45.920
No?

41:48.460 --> 41:49.420
Why not?

41:51.110 --> 41:52.080
Who are you to refuse?

41:53.850 --> 41:54.850
Why is it that everyone

41:54.880 --> 41:55.880
gets to say no to me?

41:57.150 --> 41:58.320
Wuniang, don't do this.

41:58.590 --> 41:59.710
Wuniang, don't do that.

42:00.590 --> 42:01.510
I've heard enough.

42:02.540 --> 42:03.900
I'm sick of it.

42:05.250 --> 42:06.020
Listen to me.

42:07.070 --> 42:07.710
I want it.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.480
I want everything.

42:10.320 --> 42:11.800
The only thing I don't want now

42:12.480 --> 42:14.440
is to keep being Feng Wuniang.

42:15.230 --> 42:16.150
I don't want to be

42:16.150 --> 42:17.590
a puppet manipulated by others anymore!

42:18.210 --> 42:19.180
But in my eyes,

42:20.550 --> 42:22.070
no one is manipulating you.

42:26.130 --> 42:26.900
All this self-righteous talk

42:26.920 --> 42:28.750
you're spouting now—

42:30.300 --> 42:30.990
isn't it just you

42:31.010 --> 42:32.080
justifying everything

42:32.110 --> 42:33.190
from your own perspective?

42:34.440 --> 42:35.960
You say your father imprisoned you,

42:37.510 --> 42:38.760
but what did he really do?

42:39.830 --> 42:40.620
Didn't he stay here

42:40.650 --> 42:41.430
just to be with you,

42:41.460 --> 42:42.540
even giving up going home?

42:44.110 --> 42:45.510
It's all your fault.

42:46.330 --> 42:47.560
You took lives without care,

42:47.590 --> 42:48.510
killed the innocent,

42:48.860 --> 42:49.460
and became

42:49.480 --> 42:50.840
an unscrupulous evil demon.

42:51.420 --> 42:52.130
Do you really think

42:52.150 --> 42:53.360
killing me today

42:53.590 --> 42:54.800
will make you become me?

42:55.340 --> 42:56.730
Even if you wear my face

42:56.760 --> 42:57.590
and leave this place,

42:58.270 --> 42:58.790
my family

42:58.820 --> 43:00.170
will see through you at a glance.

43:01.970 --> 43:03.600
Do you really think changing your appearance

43:03.630 --> 43:04.960
can change your life?

43:05.110 --> 43:06.150
It's impossible!

43:06.960 --> 43:07.850
Miss Duan,

43:11.630 --> 43:13.280
you're so sharp with words.

43:16.360 --> 43:17.280
No wonder…

43:18.670 --> 43:20.190
I like you more and more.

43:24.400 --> 43:26.150
If things turn out just like you said,

43:27.620 --> 43:29.470
and your family sees through me at a glance,

43:33.460 --> 43:35.500
then I'll send them to hell

43:36.350 --> 43:37.830
to keep you company!
